    <title>mysql-net/MySqlConnector - Releases - 2025-11-12</title>
    <id>https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector#2025-11-12</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector" />
    <updated>2025-11-13T00:07:43Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/releases/tag/2.5.0"&gt;2.5.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h1&gt;2.5.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support .NET 10: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3473268736" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1595" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/pull/1595/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/pull/1595"&gt;#1595&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Possibly breaking&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;MySqlConnection.State&lt;/code&gt; will be set to &lt;code&gt;ConnectionState.Broken&lt;/code&gt; when there is a network error: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3532828768" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1599" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1599/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1599"&gt;#1599&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previously it would have been set to &lt;code&gt;ConnectionState.Closed&lt;/code&gt; but the connection wasn't truly closed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call &lt;code&gt;MySqlConnection.Close()&lt;/code&gt; to fully close the connection before calling &lt;code&gt;Open()&lt;/code&gt; again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Better yet, call &lt;code&gt;.Dispose()&lt;/code&gt; (ideally with a &lt;code&gt;using&lt;/code&gt; declaration) and create a new &lt;code&gt;MySqlConnection&lt;/code&gt; instance to recover from failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Possibly breaking&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;MySqlConnection.ResetConnectionAsync&lt;/code&gt; will consistently throw a &lt;code&gt;MySqlException&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3554661759" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1602" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1602/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1602"&gt;#1602&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement MariaDB &lt;code&gt;PARSEC&lt;/code&gt; authentication: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2780871276" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1540" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1540/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1540"&gt;#1540&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3613089539" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1606" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1606/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1606"&gt;#1606&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the &lt;code&gt;VECTOR&lt;/code&gt; data type: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2873403630" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1549" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1549/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1549"&gt;#1549&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement &lt;code&gt;COM_STMT_SEND_LONG_DATA&lt;/code&gt; to stream large parameter values: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="807694135" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/943" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/943/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/943"&gt;#943&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;MySqlConnectorTracingOptions&lt;/code&gt; and builder APIs to configure tracing output: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2682853042" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1524" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1524/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1524"&gt;#1524&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read &lt;code&gt;Guid&lt;/code&gt; values from stored procedure out parameters: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2704967593" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1528" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1528/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1528"&gt;#1528&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mark &lt;code&gt;MySqlDbType&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;code&gt;[DbProviderSpecificTypeProperty(true)]&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2954606789" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1557" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1557/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1557"&gt;#1557&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow loopback connections (e.g., Google Cloud SQL Proxy) to use clear-text password or public key retrieval: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2739479781" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1534" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1534/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1534"&gt;#1534&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2811321705" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1542" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1542/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1542"&gt;#1542&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve schema metadata with MariaDB by reading stored procedure metadata from &lt;code&gt;mysql.proc&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2834969143" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1547" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1547/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1547"&gt;#1547&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve XA transaction rollback handling: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3338624938" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1585" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1585/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1585"&gt;#1585&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3374820234" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1589" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/pull/1589/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/pull/1589"&gt;#1589&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free large cached payload buffers when returning sessions to the pool to reduce memory usage: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3342417228" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1587" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1587/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1587"&gt;#1587&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suppress error-level logging when a command is canceled: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2818807353" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1544" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1544/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1544"&gt;#1544&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;MySqlBulkCopy&lt;/code&gt; auto-detected column mappings: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3030101149" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1568" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1568/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1568"&gt;#1568&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;Foreign Keys&lt;/code&gt; schema SQL syntax: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3537747701" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1601" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/pull/1601/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/pull/1601"&gt;#1601&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix extra roundtrip for &lt;code&gt;caching_sha2_password&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2974297593" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1562" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1562/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1562"&gt;#1562&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix cancellation with AWS RDS Proxy: &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3273105023" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1581" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1581/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mysql-net/MySqlConnector/issues/1581"&gt;#1581&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimization: Use &lt;code&gt;System.Threading.Lock&lt;/code&gt; for .NET 9.0+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimization: Use &lt;code&gt;PemEncoding&lt;/code&gt; in .NET 5.0+ and UTF-8 methods in .NET 10.0+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thanks to &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/djeman/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/djeman"&gt;@djeman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jnoordsij/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jnoordsij"&gt;@jnoordsij&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NETSphereSoft/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NETSphereSoft"&gt;@NETSphereSoft&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/PatrickMNL/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/PatrickMNL"&gt;@PatrickMNL&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/petedishman/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/petedishman"&gt;@petedishman&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rusher/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rusher"&gt;@rusher&lt;/a&gt; for contributions to this release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
